                "url": "https://github.com/neovim/neovim/pull/42932",
                "title": "feat(connect): follow `Include` directives in ssh config",
                "body": "Problem: `:connect` (no args) doesn't process `Include` directives in ~/.ssh/config, so hosts\ndefined in included files are missing from the menu\n\nSolution: recursively parse included files in `parse_ssh_config()`\n\ncloses: #42931",
                "state": "MERGED",
                "isDraft": false,
                "createdAt": "2026-11-21T10:43:13Z",
                "updatedAt": "2026-11-22T12:34:43Z",
